{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1dcaaba7c6b411b0fbcd54e83d791d73f6a741ba2afdaa015087ae180720f870", "ja": "（今日は、風花のフラワーショーライブだ！\nその休憩時間、一緒に会場近くを散策していると……）", "zh": "（今天是风花的花卉秀演唱会！在休息时间和她一起在会场附近散步时……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8bcc5e342ce25f42729c274a2262d9a175220326ebceb1f7c69b41c0a854ee86", "ja": "うわあ、すごいですね、{$P$}さん。\n一面、桜でいっぱいですよ♪", "zh": "哇，好漂亮啊，{$P$}先生。\n放眼望去，到处都是樱花呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "312e5077d4c4caa8d83ba390f865bf0255dbdff9406efcfcf55e5b6edb85257f", "ja": "ああ、綺麗な場所だな。\nちょうど今が見頃かもしれない。", "zh": "啊，真是个漂亮的地方。\n现在正好是赏樱的最佳时期也说不定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cc244f51ba4b02d39381527e13fd6be7d778b42c6bdb6e39163eb786a71ed553", "ja": "ついてますね♪　素敵な景色と桜の香りに包まれて……\nすごく、リラックスしちゃいます。", "zh": "真幸运呢♪ 被美丽的景色和樱花的香气包围着……\n感觉特别放松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d86e09aa653e5c01d53d164bf4c02a9a3880043a9a656d52b6fc7fcb631052a7", "ja": "すごいですよね、お花って。\n見ても楽しめますし、香りでも癒やされるんですから。", "zh": "花儿真厉害呢。\n既能欣赏，又能用香气治愈人心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cf2ddd4e9279c697ff7fa75dbab621617dbf1d7c78c61f1f050769ff8d043251", "ja": "風花だって、みんなを癒やしてると思うよ。\n昼のステージは、大盛り上がりだったぞ！", "zh": "我觉得风花也一直在治愈大家啊。\n白天的舞台，气氛非常热烈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "56867598333185001e443f9ce9245aca4714ed7a0a303d1521ef51f037bf6baa", "ja": "その盛り上がりは、違う意味じゃ……。\n春の女神様の役だから、清楚な衣装だと思ってたのに。", "zh": "那种热闹，应该不是那个意思吧……  \n因为演的是春之女神，我还以为会是清纯风格的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4f806273faebe70223c810aff7cd5e065c20d4454a64df98d1ad139372c631bb", "ja": "まさか、お花で作った水着だったなんて……。\n私……は、恥ずかしかったんですから！", "zh": "没想到竟然是用花做的泳装……。\n我……可是很害羞的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1859611a45407c0274a565970cab6d00073e00ba756b6a86418886d63b1426a4", "ja": "すまない風花。事前にしっかり説明すればよかったな。\n夜の部は、ちゃんとした衣装だから安心してくれ！", "zh": "抱歉，风花。要是事先好好说明一下就好了。\n晚场是正经的服装，你放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9050cd7b6a193169f66afbae54062deed01ca861968f9214cda03e71e607f2e9", "ja": "はい。不安だったので、さっき私も確認しました。\n……ところで、なんだか不思議な香りがしませんか？", "zh": "好的。因为有些不安，所以我刚才也确认了一下。\n……话说回来，你们有没有觉得，好像有股不可思议的香味？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7a0332dbb4df3bd7c90480e4d1ba1c12d915b9e86635f91b6336a8e7d5740eae", "ja": "え？　クンクン……言われてみれば、そうだな。\n桜じゃない？　色んな香りが混ざってる感じだ……。", "zh": "咦？闻闻……你这么一说，好像确实是。\n是樱花吧？感觉像是混合了各种香味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d0d4bd0f8dd3ffbfaf8e29bc4067e8744fa16c84eaa24a7016d712e311897c15", "ja": "ええ。でも、桜以外に咲いてるお花はありませんね。\nどこか、ら……あっ。", "zh": "嗯。不过，除了樱花以外，没有其他盛开的花呢。\n好像是从哪里……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fc92b4edf56390b069bcfdf47fc53d79f89f64184a8b474358605b378bbfe662", "ja": "風花？　どうした？", "zh": "风花？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9e3f76bf7532ee513e42148563b1153cebf907bd59e206050b289c39676d77c6", "ja": "あの、わかっちゃいました。香りの理由……。\nさっきの衣装、お花がたくさん付いてましたよね。", "zh": "那个，我知道了。香味的原因……\n刚才的那套服装上，点缀着许多花朵对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1014_p", "source_sha256": "11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142", "ja": "あっ！", "zh": "啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6d0958d0872c725c63deff6cfad6ae9b36e20fc78baadb9c2af470b1a6525d27", "ja": "す、すみませんっ、{$P$}さん！\nできれば、あまり近づかないでもらえると……！", "zh": "对、对不起，{$P$}先生！\n如果可以的话，能不能请您别靠得太近……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1016_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0423_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "07b7a775795e486ffbfac42c3aa105f8eb536b50bddf289052fd06d749ec3ae2", "ja": "別に嫌だとかそう言うわけじゃなくて……あの、\nこういうのは良くないというか、その、えっと～！", "zh": "并不是讨厌什么的……那个，  \n只是觉得这样不太好，呃，这个～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
